\id 1JN - Bwaidoka 
\h 1 Iyoni 
\toc3 1Iyo 
\toc1 Iyoni Yana Leta Nagona Givetokilumina 
\toc2 1 Iyoni 
\mt1 Iyoni Yana Leta Nagona Givetokilumina  
\is1 Kivemala  
\ip Yeisu gilaka gabameya muline, malamala sikisiti (60) giavaidi ada Iyoni, banae Yeisu yana tonogala seyana ani Efeso wagaine gimiyamiya aku yana leta nagona taidei givetokilumi ginau tovetumagana badi imiyamiya Eisiya anafafaliya. Kaduwe, Iyoni buki-dina givetokilumidi adiyegana Valeya Iwakana Iyoni Givetokilumina, ada kaduwe Yeisu Keliso Yana Ivemogatala.  
\ip Leta taidei wagaine Iyoni yana nuwanuwa iluwei giseyegemonedi. Seyana ani tovetumagana giluwageyedi toyogina e ada ina mididi Yaubada ke Natuna Yeisu Keliso gagana faidiya. Bademowa taudiyavo iawaegedi Yaubada wagaine ke inuwakabubuyena, e ada adilauboda-mowa ke ina venuwanuwakabubu seyana seyana. Yana nuwanuwa anavelu ani tovetumagana givonamatawedi tovewala fwayafwaya faidiya. Taidei tovewala-dina ani ivevewala sidamana, ivonavona, “Vovoda ani keke tamo wa adiiwakana, ada wagaidiya-deya koyona gagana giyegeyegemona wagaideya. Tainei faina Keliso anaita ani velemoena kaliva, aku keke velemoena. E ada Banae keke velemoena Yaubada Natuna.” Kaduwe tovewala-dina ivetumagana vaita alamana gaitoma lakaina aku nuwakabubu ani keke. Taide tovewala-dina ani Keliso nibainavo, e ada Iyoni yadi fwaya-dina giivemogatalidi Yaubada yana vewala velemoena wagaine.  
\io1 Vona wayawaina. \ior (1:1-4)\ior*  
\io1 Yaubada Tauna malina, ada kana miyamiya wagaine. \ior (1:5 - 2:17)\ior*  
\io1 Matawa gimaduyegemona Keliso nibainavo faidiya. \ior (2:18-29)\ior*  
\io1 Ideyavo ani Yaubada natunavo, e ada kanamiya anafaiweya. \ior (3:1 - 4:6)\ior*  
\io1 Yaubada ide ginuwakabubuyeda e ada gilubodada ide kaduwe kaliva kana nuwakabubuyedi. \ior (4:7-21)\ior*  
\io1 Vetumagana Yaubada Natuna wagaine. \ior (5:1-12)\ior*  
\io1 Vona anaebalauyabu. \ior (5:13-21)\ior*  
\c 1  
\s1 Vona wayawaina.  
\p
\v 1 Vona Banae Wayawaina\x † \xo 1:1 \xt Iyo 1:1,4\x* gimiyamiya ebavevuvu velemoena wagaine ani bademowa taumeyavo anogalina, matameya aitana ke amatawabuwabuyena, ada nimama asena wagaine.\f ** \fr 1:1 \ft Muliya-yo Iyoni leta-nai givetokilumina, banae afositoloyavo nodi Yeisu iitana velemoena.\f*  
\v 2 Yawai-nai Tauna giivemogatalina ke ime aitana,\x † \xo 1:2 \xt Iyo 1:14\x* ada Banae faine aifufuyena ke aawatalatalainena wagaimiya, Tauna Banae Yawai-vagata. Yaubada Tamada nodi imiyamiya ani Tauna giivemogatalina wagaimeya.  
\v 3 Ada gavana aitana ke anogalina ani aawamogatalena wagaimiya, e ada kadu imi nodi kana vetubuiyana. Ada velemoena yada vetubuiyana ani Tamada ke Natuna Yeisu Keliso nodi.  
\v 4 Taidei avetokiluma wagaimiya e ada yama vemwamwala gina tubuga velemoena.   
\s1 Yaubada Tauna malina, ada kana miyamiya wagaine.  
\p
\v 5 Ifufu taidei anogalina Yeisu wagaine ada aawatalatalaina wagaimiya, ani Yaubada Tauna malina,\x † \xo 1:5 \xt Iyem 1:17, 1Tim 6:16\x* ada yuyuvana ani au keke-mowa Banae wagaine. \fig Yaubada yana malina ani yuyuvana giweuweuna.|alt="oil lamp" src="Oillam_d.tif" size="col" loc="1:5-7" copy="SIL/Wegmann" ref="1:5" \fig*  
\v 6 Kai ide kavona evona Yaubada nodi kavetubuiyana aku yada dewa ani yuyuvana wagaine kanunudadana,\x † \xo 1:6 \xt Iyo 12:35-36, 1Iyo 2:4\x* ina ideyavo ani tovefwayafwaya, ada yada vona ke yada gugai wagaidiya nuwanuwa velemoena keke kada mulimuliye.  
\v 7 Aku Yaubada malina wagaine gimiyamiya. E ada kai ide kadu Banae anafaiweya malina wagaine kanunudadana,\x † \xo 1:7 \xt Ais 2:5\x* aga kavetubuiyana taudeyavo wagaideya, ada Natuna Yeisu dayagine gikiveyegayegada koyona matatabuna wagaidiya-deya.\x † \xo 1:7 \xt Ibel 9:14, 1Pi 1:18-19, Ive 5:9, 7:14, 12:10-11\x*  
\v 8 Kai ide kanavona, “Keke tamo koyona wagaideya,” wada tauda kafwayanegenegeda ada vona anavelemoena ani keke wagaideya.  
\v 9 Aku kai yada dewa koyodi kana awatalatalaina Yaubada wagaine, aga yada koyona gina venuwaegedi ke gina kiveyegayegada yada dewa bwanene matatabuna wagaine. Faina anafaiweya Banae givona, gina gugai, ada anafaiweya yana nuwanuwa tunutunugina, ginadewa tunutunugina.  
\v 10 Kai ide kanavona, “Keke tamo kada koyona,” aga Yaubada kasesena vaita Banae tofwaya, ada yana vona velemoena keke gida miyami aseaseda wagaidiya.   
\c 2  
\p
\v 1 Natukuweyavo, taidei gavetokiluma wagaimiya e ada keke wanadewa koyona. Aku kai tamo gaito gina koyona, aga adaTolubadigolagola gimiyamiya, Yeisu Keliso. Banae Toyegayegana, ada Tamada wagaine giveoveola faideya.\x † \xo 2:1 \xt Lom 8:34, 1Tim 2:5, Ibel 7:25, 9:24\x*  
\v 2 Banae Tauna bolavoi-menai, ada yada koyona faina gifatana e ada Yaubada yana nuwakoyo yada koyona faine ani nuwana gibubuna.\x † \xo 2:2 \xt Lom 3:25, 1Iyo 4:10\x* Ada keke ide yada koyona gaga faine gida alika, aku kaduwe babi matatabuna anakalivayavo yadi koyona faidiya gialika.\x † \xo 2:2 \xt Iyo 1:29, 11:52\x*   
\p
\v 3 Kai Yaubada yana veimeya kamatawalewaleyena, aga kana alamanena velemoena ani ide Banae kaalamanena.  
\v 4 Gavakaliva gina vonavona, “Iya Yaubada gaalamanena” aku yana veimeya keke gida itaveyabi, kaliva tainei ani tovefwayafwaya, ada vona anavelemoena keke tauna wagaine gida miyami.\x † \xo 2:4 \xt 1Iyo 1:6,8\x*  
\v 5 Aku kai gaito Yaubada yana vona gimatawalewaleyena, vona velemoena banae ani Yaubada yana nuwakabubu givekaliva yawaina wagaine.\x † \xo 2:5 \xt Iyo 14:21,23, 1Iyo 4:12, 5:3\x* Taidei wagaine kaalamanena ani kamiyamiya Yaubada wagaine.  
\v 6 Kai gaito ginavona, “Iya Yaubada wagaine gamiyamiya,”\x † \xo 2:6 \xt Iyo 15:4-5,7-8\x* gilubodana banae ginadewa anafaiweya Yeisu gidewa.\x † \xo 2:6 \xt Iyo 13:15\x*   
\s1 Kaliva kana nuwakabubuyedi ke kana miyamiya malina wagaine.  
\p
\v 7 Tubuiya aseasekuweyavo, keke vaita veimeya evaguna gada vetokilumi wagaimiya,\x † \xo 2:7 \xt Iyo 13:34, 2Iyo 1:5-6\x* aku veimeya tuwaina faina gavetokiluma, tainei ebavevuvu wagaine gimiyamiya wagaimiya. Veimeya taidei tuwaina ani anaifufu bademowa wanogalina.  
\v 8 Aku kaduwe veimeya taidei vaita evaguna. Ada veimeya-nai ananuwanuwa tunutunugina iitana Banae Keliso wagaine ke imi wagaimiya, faina yuyuvana giavavaina aku malina velemoena bademowa gituituimalina.\x † \xo 2:8 \xt Iyo 1:9, 8:12\x*  
\v 9 Gaito ginavona, “Iya gamiyamiya malina wagaine” aku tubuiyana giagougena, ina banae aimo yuyuvana wagaine gimiyamiya.\x † \xo 2:9 \xt 1Iyo 3:10,15, 4:20\x*  
\v 10 Gavakaliva tubuiyana ginuwakabubuyena ani banae gimiyamiya malina wagaine, ada nuwainagena wagaine keke tamo gavavuvu gida miyami ke ginabe koyona wagaine.\x † \xo 2:10 \xt Lom 14:13\x*  
\v 11 Aku gaito tubuiyana giagougena, banae yuyuvana wagaine gimiyamiya ada ginunudadana yuyuvana wagaine. Keke gida alamane gadedeku ginauna, faina yuyuvana matana gisebodana.   
\p
\v 12 Natukuweyavo, gavetokiluma wagaimiya faina Yaubada yami koyona givenuwaegena Keliso wagaine.   
\p
\v 13 Imi kamakuweyavo, gavetokiluma wagaimiya faina bademowa waalamanena Yeisu, Banae tova nagona ebavevuvu velemoena wagaine gimiyamiya.  
\p Imi kaikuweyavo, gavetokiluma wagaimiya faina kaliva koyona Seitani wagaine bademowa walugaviya ke watoyogisegena.  
\p Kaduwe natukuweyavo, imi wagaimiya gavetokiluma faina Tamada waalamanena.   
\p
\v 14 Imi kamakuweyavo, gavetokiluma wagaimiya faina bademowa waalamanena Keliso, Banae ebavevuvu velemoena wagaine-deya gimiyamiya-vagata.  
\p Imi kaikuweyavo, gavetokiluma wagaimiya faina toyogimiyavo, ada Yaubada yana vona gimiyamiya aseasemiya, ada kaliva koyona Seitani wagaine walugaviya ada watoyogisegena.\f ** \fr 2:14 \ft Maita 12-14 ani ‘natukuweyavo’ ananuwanuwa anavelu anafaiweya ‘tovetumagana evagudiyavo’, ‘tama’ anafaiweya ‘tovetumagana toyogina,’ ada ‘kaikuweyavo’ anafaiweya ‘tovetumagana galuvaluva’. \f* \fig Iyoni yana leta givetovetokilumina.|alt="man writing" src="cn02103B.tif" size="col" copy="DCC" ref="2:14" \fig*   
\s1 Babi ananuwanuwa keke nuwami ginadola.  
\p
\v 15 Babi ananuwanuwa ke anakaikaiwabuyavo ani keke nuwami ginadola.\x † \xo 2:15 \xt Lom 8:7, 12:2, 2Tim 4:10, Iyem 4:4 \x* Kai gaito babi ananuwanuwa nuwana gidolana, aga Tamada ananuwakabubu ani keke gida miyami wagaine.  
\v 16 Faina dewa moyaina babi wagaine imiyamiya, anafaiweya kaliva vovodi ananuwanuwa koyodi inuwanuwayedi,\x † \xo 2:16 \xt Lom 13:14, Efes 2:3, 2Pi 2:18\x* gavana gavana faidiya matadi iitaitavedigaga,\x † \xo 2:16 \xt Tol 4:8, 5:11\x* ada kadu gavadi moyaidi faidiya taudiyavo adiyegana ikikilakaina. Taidei gaitoma-dina keke idaela Tamada wagaine aku matatabuna ielai babi ananuwanuwa koyona wagaine.  
\v 17 Ada babi anakalivayavo keke Yaubada ida vemoimoine kadu yadi nuwanuwa luvadiga ani iavavaina, aku badi gavega Yaubada yana nuwanuwa igugaiyena ani ina miyamiya-vagata.   
\s1 Matawa gimaduyegemona Keliso nibainavo faidiya.  
\p
\v 18 Natukuweyavo, tova anaebalauyabu givelilivana. Ada anafaiweya bademowa wanogalina vaita Keliso Nibaina gina yegemona, ani malinai bademowa Keliso nibainavo moyaidi iyegemona.\x † \xo 2:18 \xt 1Iyo 4:3, 2Iyo 7\x* Taidei wagaine kaalamanena tova anaebalauyabu bademowa gielai.  
\v 19 Kaliva-dina taidei keke velemoena ide tovetumagana yada yoo wagaine, e ada isegeda inau.\x † \xo 2:19 \xt Gug 20:30\x* Kai badi velemoena yada yoo aga ida miyamiya wagaideya. Aku yadi nau-nai givewaleda vaita badi moyaidi keke ide yada yoo wagaine.   
\p
\v 20 Aku imiyavo ani Yaubada Tabutabuna Aluwaluwana gibiwana wagaimiya, e ada moyaimi vona velemoena waalamanena.  
\v 21 Taidei faina Iya gavetokiluma wagaimiya, keke vaita vona velemoena keke wada alamane faine, aku velemoena ani waalamanena. Ada kaduwe faina waalamanena ani Yaubada yana vona velemoena wagaine keke tamo fwaya gida elaela.  
\v 22 Aku gaito tovefwayafwaya? Tainei gaito banae gina veweyena Yeisu evona keke Keliso.\x † \xo 2:22 \xt 1Iyo 4:3, 2Iyo 7\x* Kaliva-nai ani Keliso nibaina, banae giveweyena Tamada ke Natuna.  
\v 23 Badi gavega iveveweyena Yeisu aga ina Tamada keke gida miyami badi wagaidiya.\x † \xo 2:23 \xt Mad 10:32-33, Iyo 5:23, 2Iyo 9\x* Aku gavega ivonavonamogatala Yeisu Banae Yaubada Natuna, ina badi wagaidiya kaduwe Tamada gimiyamiya.   
\p
\v 24 Aku imiyavo ani wana itaveyabimi ada gavana nagona wanogalina ani wana duveyalaina aseasemiya. Kai gavana nagona wanogalina ani gina miyamiya aseasemiya, aga imiyavo tova moyaina wana luveyabina Tamada ke Natuna wagaidiya.  
\v 25 Ada taidei luveyabina-nai wagaine yawai-vagata kanuwanuwagana,\x † \xo 2:25 \xt Iyo 3:14-15, 6:40, 17:1-2\x* anafaiweya givonadabadabayena.   
\p
\v 26 Gaitoma-dina taidei gavetokiluma wagaimiya, faina biyavo-dina ibalabalalava ina fwayanegenegemi yadi vewala balana wagaine.  
\v 27 Aku Keliso Aluwaluwa Tabuna gibiwana wagaimiya e ada tova moyaina Banae gimiyamiya wagaimiya. Taidei faina keke wana nuwanuwa vaita seyana gaito gida vevewalemi, faina Banae Aluwaluwa-nai gaitoma matatabuna givevewalemi.\x † \xo 2:27 \xt Iyo 14:26\x* Ada yana vewala ani vona velemoena, keke tamo fwaya wagaine. Ada anafaiweya givewalemi, wana miyaveyalata Banae Keliso wagaine.   
\p
\v 28 Ada natukuweyavo, tova moyaina wana miyaveyalata Banae wagaine e ada tova-nai gina yegemona, ide wa yada asevatu keke kana vovomumu Banae matane yana ela-nai wagaine.\x † \xo 2:28 \xt 1Iyo 4:17\x*  
\v 29 Imi waalamanena ani Keliso Banae yegayega-moena, e ada anafaiweya kaduwe wana alamanena gavega idewadewa yegayegana, badi Yaubada wagaine itubuga.\x † \xo 2:29 \xt 1Iyo 3:10\x*   
\c 3  
\s1 Ideyavo ani Yaubada natunavo, e ada kanamiya anafaiweya.  
\p
\v 1 Wana itana nuwakabubu taidei gavatubuga Tamada gibiwana wagaideya e ada givewagada ‘natunavo’!\x † \xo 3:1 \xt Iyo 1:12-13\x* Ada velemoena ideyavo Yaubada natunavo! Aku tomiyababi moyaidi keke nuwadi gidamali vaita ide natunavo, faina keke Yaubada ida alamane.\x † \xo 3:1 \xt Iyo 16:3, 17:25\x*  
\v 2 Tubuiya aseasekuweyavo, ika, malinai ideyavo ani Yaubada natunavo, ada aimo keke gida mogatala wagaideya gavaiyamu gina sevedavedameda. Aku kaalamanena ani tova-nai Keliso ginayewa-vagilena, ideyavo anafaiweya Tauna,\x † \xo 3:2 \xt 2Kol 3:18\x* faina Tau-moena kana itana anafaiweya gimiyamiya.  
\v 3 Ada gavega nuwanuwami Keliso anaitaita anafaiweya amiita gina yegemona ani faina wanuwavetumagana.\x † \xo 3:3 \xt Lom 15:12\x* Ada Banae yegayega-moena anafaiweya, imi seyana seyana tauna yawaina gikikiveyegayeganena.   
\p
\v 4 Aku badi gavega ikoyokoyona aga Yaubada yana veimeya iyaweyawelina. Ada velemoena dewa koyona ani veimeya anaiyawela.  
\v 5 Aku waalamanena ani Keliso giobuelai ke kaliva yada koyona gina vaiyavulena faina.\x † \xo 3:5 \xt Ais 53:11-12, Iyo 1:29, 2Kol 5:21, Ibel 9:26, 1Pi 2:22-24\x* Ada Banae wagaine keke tamo koyona gida miyami.  
\v 6 Gaito gimiyaveyalata Keliso wagaine ani keke gida koyona-vavagila. Aku gaito gikoyona-vavagila, keke-mowa Keliso gida itainana o gida alamane.   
\p
\v 7 Natukuweyavo, keke wana awaege seyana gaito gina fwayanegenegemi. Tauna gaito tova moyaina yana dewa yegayegana, banae toyegayegana anafaiweya Keliso Banae Toyegayegana.\x † \xo 3:7 \xt 1Iyo 2:29\x*  
\v 8 Aku banae gaito tova moyaina gikoyokoyona, ina banae Seitani yana kaliva,\x † \xo 3:8 \xt Mad 13:38\x* faina tuwai-moena babi anaebavevuvu wagaine-deya Seitani banae gikoyokoyona ada gielai tova malinai. Taidei vuvuna Yaubada Natuna giobuelai ani Seitani yana gugai gina luyawelidi.  
\v 9 Badi gavega Yaubada wagaine itubuga ani keke koyona ida faifaisewa ayo ida naunauwe tova manamanawena, faina Yaubada yawaina gimiyamiya wagaidiya. Keke adifata ina koyona-vavagila, faina Yaubada wagaine itubuga.\x † \xo 3:9 \xt 1Iyo 5:18\x*  
\v 10 Gavaiyamu kana alamane gavega Yaubada natunavo ada gavega Seitani natunavo? Kai kaliva yana dewa keke yegayegana, banae keke Yaubada natuna. Kadu kai kaliva tubuiyana keke gida nuwakabubuye, banae keke Yaubada natuna. Taidei anafaiweya kana alamanena.   
\s1 Moyaida kana venuwanuwakabubu.  
\p
\v 11 Faina taidei valeya-nai wanogalina nago-moena wagaine, ani adalauboda moyaida kana venuwanuwakabubu.\x † \xo 3:11 \xt Iyo 13:34-35\x*  
\v 12 Keke Keni Adama natuna anafaiweya kanadewa, banae Seitani yana kaliva ada anatubuluga giluvealikana.\x † \xo 3:12 \xt Eba 4:4,8, Ibel 11:4, Iyud 11\x* Aku gavana faina taina giluvealika? Faina tauna yana gugai ani koyona aku taina yana gugai tunutunugina. \fig Keni anatubuluga Ebeli giluvealikana.|alt="Cain kills Abel" src="CO00617B.TIF" size="col" loc="3:12" copy="DCC" ref="3:12" \fig*  
\v 13 E ada tubuiyakuweyavo, kai tomiyababi ina agougemi aga keke wana tataweyana.\x † \xo 3:13 \xt Iyo 15:18-21\x*  
\v 14 Gavaiyamu kana alamane alika anawai kasegena aku kadamana yawai-vagata anawai?\x † \xo 3:14 \xt Iyo 5:24\x* Taidei anafaiweya. Tubuiyadeyavo kanuwakabubuyedi. Gavega keke ida nuwakabubu, ina badi inaunau alika anawai wagaine.  
\v 15 Gavega tubuiyadi wagaine iagouga ani badi toluvealika,\x † \xo 3:15 \xt Mad 5:21-22\x* ada waalamanena toluvealika ani keke yawai-vagata anawai wagaine ida nauna.   
\p
\v 16 Ada gavaiyamu nuwakabubu anadewa kana alamane? Keliso yawaina giawaegena ide faideya.\x † \xo 3:16 \xt Iyo 10:11, 15:13\x* Ada ideyavo kaduwe gilubodada taudeyavo yawaida kada awaegena tubuiyadeyavo faidiya. Taidei anafaiweya kana alamanena.  
\v 17 Aku kai gaito seyana wa yana lokoloko ada gina itana tubuiyana ani lema gilubodana aku keke gida nuwakalikaliye ada gidaleme,\x † \xo 3:17 \xt 2Vei 15:7-11\x* aga Yaubada ananuwakabubu keke banae wagaine.  
\v 18 Natukuweyavo, keke kana nuwakabubu vona gaga wagaine, aku kana nuwakabubu velemoena wa yada gugai nodi.\x † \xo 3:18 \xt 2Vei 15:7-11, Iyem 2:15-16\x*  
\v 19 Taidei gugai-nai wagaine kana alamanena ideyavo kamiyamiya vona velemoena wagaine, e ada aseaseda gina kivevatuna Yaubada matane.  
\v 20 Gavatoveya nuwainagedeya kanuwanuwa vaita ide kakoyona, aga nuwada gina niwalova, faina Yaubada gialamaneda velemoena aku yada nuwanuwa kabisona.  
\v 21 Tubuiyakuweyavo, kai nuwainagedeya kalutovonina vaita yada dewa moyaina yegayegana Yaubada yana nuwanuwa anafaiweya, aga wa yada asevatu kamiyamiya Yaubada matane.  
\v 22 Ada kaduwe gavana kana veolena, tainei kana nuwagana Banae wagaine, faina yana veimeya kamatawalewaleyena ada kagugai gavana anafaiweya yana nuwanuwa.\x † \xo 3:22 \xt Iyo 15:7\x*  
\v 23 Ada taidei yana veimeya, ani Natuna Yeisu Keliso anayegana kana vetumaganena,\x † \xo 3:23 \xt Iyo 6:29\x* ada moyaida kana venuwanuwakabubu\x † \xo 3:23 \xt Iyo 13:34, 15:12,17\x* anafaiweya giveimeyeda.  
\v 24 Imiyavo gavega Yaubada yana veimeya wamatawalewaleyena ani Yaubada wagaine wamiyamiya, ada Banae gimiyamiya wagaimiya. Gavaiyamu kana alamane Banae gimiyamiya wagaideya? Kaalamanena faina Yaubada Aluwaluwana giveleda ke Banae nuwainagedeya gimiyamiya.\x † \xo 3:24 \xt Lom 8:9\x*   
\c 4  
\s1 Wana itaveyabimi Keliso nibainavo wagaidiya, badi falofita fwayafwaya.  
\p
\v 1 Tubuiya aseasekuweyavo, keke kaliva moyaidi yadi vewala wana madu vetumaganedi vaita wada vona velemoena, aku wana galuvaluvana aluwaluwa-nai ivegugaiyena, kai giyegeyegemona Yaubada wagaine-deya o kai keke. Faina falofita fwayafwaya moyaidi bademowa iyegemona babi anafafali tulina tulina wagaidiya.\x † \xo 4:1 \xt Mad 24:11\x*  
\v 2 Gavaiyamu wana alamane Yaubada Aluwaluwana falofita awane giifuifufuye? Tainei kai ina awamogatala vaita Yeisu Keliso giobuelai ke givekaliva-mowa, aga banae velemoena Yaubada wagaine.\x † \xo 4:2 \xt 1Kol 12:3\x*  
\v 3 Aku gava aluwaluwa kaliva-nai wagaine gina awamogatala vaita Yeisu keke gida obuela ke gida vekaliva-mowa, tainei aluwaluwa-nai keke gidaela Yaubada wagaine aku banae Keliso nibaina wagaine.\x † \xo 4:3 \xt 2Iyo 7\x* Bademowa wanogalina vaita ginaelai, ada velemoena malinai bademowa giela gimiyamiya babi matatabuna wagaine.   
\p
\v 4 Aku natukuweyavo, imiyavo Yaubada yana kalivayavo, ada falofita fwayafwaya watoyogisegedi. Faina Aluwaluwa Tabuna gimiyamiya wagaimiya ani toyogi-moena aku banae aluwaluwa-nai koyona kaliva moyaidi imuliyena, yana toyogina keke anafaiweya.  
\v 5 Badiyavo falofita fwayafwaya ani babi anakalivayavo, tayuwe faina iifufu babi ananuwanuwa wagaine, ada tomiyababi yadi nuwanuwa ivenogalena.\x † \xo 4:5 \xt Iyo 15:19\x*  
\v 6 Aku ideyavo ani Yaubada yana kalivayavo. Gavega Yaubada ialamanena, bonada ina venogalena, aku gavega keke Yaubada yana kaliva, keke bonada ida venogale.\x † \xo 4:6 \xt Iyo 8:47\x* Taidei anafaiweya kana itainanana Aluwaluwa Tabuna Bana yana vewala vuvuna ani vona velemoena, ada aluwaluwa koyona bana yana vewala ani vuvuna vefwayafwaya.   
\s1 Yaubada ide ginuwakabubuyeda e ada gilubodada ide kaduwe kaliva kana nuwakabubuyedi.  
\p
\v 7 Tubuiyakuweyavo, moyaida kana venuwanuwakabubu, faina nuwakabubu gielaelai Yaubada wagaine. Ada gaito kaliva ginuwanuwakabubuyedi, banae gitubuga Yaubada wagaine ada gialamanena Yaubada.  
\v 8 Gaito keke kaliva gida nuwanuwakabubuyedi, keke gida alamane Yaubada, faina Yaubada Tauna ani nuwakabubu vuvuna.  
\v 9 Gavaiyamu Yaubada yana nuwakabubu ide wagaideya giseyegemone? Natuna tubueyana giimilina babi wagaine\x † \xo 4:9 \xt Iyo 3:16\x* e ada Tauna wagaine yawai-vagata kana miyanena.  
\v 10 Nuwakabubu vuvuna anaitaita taidei anafaiweya. Keke vaita ide Yaubada kanuwakabubuyena, aku Tauna ide ginuwakabubuyeda ada Natuna giimilina ke gina alika ide faideya yada koyona analaufata faina. E ada taidei vebolavoi-nai wagaine Yaubada yana nuwakoyo yada koyona faine ani nuwana gibubuna.\x † \xo 4:10 \xt Lom 5:8-10\x*  
\v 11 Tubuiya aseasekuweyavo, taidei anafaiweya Yaubada ide ginuwakabubuyeda lakaina faina, ide gilubodada kaduwe moyaida kana venuwanuwakabubu.\x † \xo 4:11 \xt Iyo 15:12\x*  
\v 12 Keke tamo tova gaito Yaubada gidaita,\x † \xo 4:12 \xt Iyo 1:18\x* aku kai moyaida kana venuwanuwakabubu aga Yaubada gimiyamiya wagaideya, ada yana nuwakabubu wagaideya ani kaseseyegemonena velemoena.   
\p
\v 13 Banae Tauna Aluwaluwana giveleda, e ada taidei wagaine kaalamanena ideyavo kamiyamiya Yaubada wagaine ada Banae gimiyamiya wagaideya.\x † \xo 4:13 \xt 2Kol 1:21-22\x*  
\v 14 Ada Tamada Natuna giimilina kaliva moyaida gina kibababaleda,\x † \xo 4:14 \xt Iyo 3:17\x* ani aitana ke aawatalatalainena.  
\v 15 Gaito gina awamogatala vaita Yeisu Banae Yaubada Natuna, aga Yaubada gimiyamiya wagaine ada banae gimiyamiya Yaubada wagaine.  
\v 16 E ada ide kaalamanena ke kavetumaganena ani Yaubada ginuwakabubuyeda. Yaubada Tauna ani nuwakabubu vuvuna, ada badi gavega imiyamiya nuwakabubu wagaine ani kadu imiyamiya Yaubada wagaine, ada Yaubada gimiyamiya wagaidiya.  
\v 17 Taidei wagaine yana nuwakabubu gitubuga-mowa wagaideya. E ada vonayavuga anatova wagaine kana asevatu, faina babi taidei wagaine bademowa ide anafaiweya Keliso.  
\v 18 Gavakaliva Yaubada yana nuwakabubu banae wagaine gilulutovonina, ina keke gina matamatauta. Ada Yaubada yana nuwakabubu velemoena banae wagaine faina, matauta givenegana. Gavakaliva gimatamatauta, yana matauta vuvuna ani ginuwanuwa kai Yaubada gina vematavulogina. E ada yana matauta faina, nuwakabubu keke gida luyabu banae wagaine.   
\p
\v 19 Yaubada nagona ide gimadunuwakabubuyeda.\x † \xo 4:19 \xt 1Iyo 4:10\x* E ada ide adalauboda Banae kana nuwakabubuyena, ada kaduwe kaliva kana nuwakabubuyedi.  
\v 20 Kai gaito gina vonaga, “Iya Yaubada ganuwakabubuyena” e aku tubuiyana wagaine giagouga, ina banae tovefwayafwaya. Faina gaito tubuiyana matane giitaitana aku keke gida nuwakabubuye, aga keke anafata Yaubada gina nuwakabubuye, Banae keke gida itaita.  
\v 21 Ada veimeya taidei Yaubada giveleda, ani gavega inuwakabubuyena Yaubada, adilauboda kaduwe tubuiyadiyavo ina nuwakabubuyedi.   
\c 5  
\s1 Vetumagana Yaubada Natuna wagaine.  
\p
\v 1 Badi gavega ivetumaganena Yeisu au Keliso\x † \xo 5:1 \xt 1Iyo 2:22 ke anaailabama adiebakivemala \x* ani badi kaliva-dina Yaubada wagaine itubuga. Ada gavega inuwakabubuyena Tamada ani kaduwe natunavo Bana wagaine itubuga inuwakabubuyedi.  
\v 2 Gavaiyamu kana alamane Yaubada natunavo kanuwakabubuyedi? Kai Yaubada kanuwakabubuyena ada kadu yana veimeya kamatawalewaleyedi.  
\v 3 Faina yada nuwakabubu Yaubada wagaine ani taidei anafaiweya. Yana veimeya kamatawalewaleyedi. Ada yana veimeya keke vitadi.\x † \xo 5:3 \xt Iyo 14:15,23-24, Mad 11:30\x*  
\v 4 Faina gavega Yaubada wagaine itubuga ani babi ananuwanuwa koyona itoyogisegena. Ada gavawai wagaine nuwanuwa-dina kana toyogisege?\x † \xo 5:4 \xt Iyo 16:33\x* Yada vetumagana wagaine.  
\v 5 Gavakaliva ani babi ananuwanuwa koyona gina toyogisege?\x † \xo 5:5 \xt Lom 8:37\x* Banae gaito givetumagana Yeisu au Yaubada Natuna.   
\p
\v 6 Yeisu Keliso ani Banae giobuelai babiya, ada gielai iyaiyaya iluwei wagaidiya, gufa ada dayaga.\f ** \fr 5:6 \ft ‘Yeisu Keliso gielai iyaiyaya iluwei wagaidiya, gufa ada dayaga’ ani ananuwanuwa taidei anafaiweya. Yeisu gufa wagaine gibabitaiso ada yana alika kelose wagaine dayagina gimadu. \f* Yana ela keke gufa gaga wagaine, aku gufa ada kadu dayaga wagaine. Ada Aluwaluwa Tabuna ani Banae giawaawamogatala anafaiweya,\x † \xo 5:6 \xt Iyo 1:32\x* faina Aluwaluwa Tabuna Banae vona velemoena.  
\v 7 Gaitoma toiye iawaawamogatala Banae Yeisu Keliso faine.  
\v 8 Seyana ani Aluwaluwa Tabuna,\x † \xo 5:8 \xt Iyo 15:26\x* anavelu gufa, ada anaveto dayaga. Ada aditoto ivonavona leleleya.  
\v 9 Kai kaliva-mowa yadi awamogatala kavetumaganena, aga velemoena Yaubada yana awamogatala kada vetumaganena, faina Tauna Yaubada.\x † \xo 5:9 \xt Mad 3:17, Iyo 5:32-37, 8:18\x* Ada Yaubada ani yana awamogatala giveleda Natuna faina.  
\v 10 Badi gavega Yaubada Natuna ivetumaganena ani Yaubada yana awamogatala Natuna faine gimiyamiya aseasedi wagaidiya. Aku gavega keke Yaubada ida vetumagane, badi isesena anafaiweya Yaubada vaita tofwaya, faina keke ida vetumagane Yaubada yana awatalatalaina giveleda Natuna faine.  
\v 11 Ada awamogatala-nai ani taidei anafaiweya. Yaubada yawai-vagata giveleda, ada yawai-nai ani Natuna wagaine.\x † \xo 5:11 \xt Iyo 1:4, 3:36\x*  
\v 12 Badi gavega Natuna wagaidiya, ani yawai-vagata imiyamiyanena.\x † \xo 5:12 \xt Iyo 3:15, 5:24, 6:40,47\x* Aku badi gavega Yaubada Natuna keke wagaidiya, ani keke yawai-vagata ida nuwaga.   
\s1 Vona anaebalauyabu.  
\p
\v 13 Imi gavega Yaubada Natuna anayeganeya wavetumagana ani yami leta taidei gavetokilumina anafaiweya, e ada wana alamane-dewedewena bademowa yawai-vagata wanuwagana ke wamiyamiya wagaine.\x † \xo 5:13 \xt Iyo 20:31\x*  
\v 14 Kai Yaubada yana nuwanuwa anafaiweya kana veola, aga kanuwaveyalaina vaita gina venogaleda.\x † \xo 5:14 \xt Iyo 14:13, 1Iyo 3:21-22\x*  
\v 15 Ada kaalamanena givenovenogaleda tova-nai kaveolena faina, kaduwe kaalamanena vaita gavana kaveola wagaine ani bademowa kanuwagana.   
\p
\v 16 Kai kana itana tubuiyada tovetumagana gikoyokoyona ada koyona-nai faine keke alika-vagata gina nuwaga, aga tubuiyada-nai faine kada veola Yaubada wagaine ada yawai iwakana gina velena.\x † \xo 5:16 \xt Iyob 42:8\x* Taidei yaku vona-nai ani badi gavega yadi koyona-nai faina keke alika-vagata wagaine inana ani faidiya. Aku tamo koyona ani faine aimo gina nauwedi alika-vagata wagaine, ada keke gada vonavona vaita koyona-nai faine kana veola Yaubada wagaine.  
\v 17 Dewa koyona matatabuna ani koyona, aku tamo koyona ani keke gina nauwe alika-vagata wagaine.   
\p
\v 18 Ide kaalamanena badi gavega itubuga Yaubada wagaine ani keke koyona ida faifaisewa ayo ida naunauwe tova manamanawena, faina Yaubada Natuna giyavayavadi\x † \xo 5:18 \xt Iyo 17:12\x* e ada banae kaliva koyona Seitani keke gina kivekoyo.  
\v 19 Ada kaalamanena ideyavo Yaubada natunavo, ada tomiyababi moyaidi ani kaliva koyona Seitani yana veimeya dibune imiyamiya.\x † \xo 5:19 \xt Luk 4:6\x*  
\v 20 Ada kaduwe kaalamanena Yaubada Natuna bademowa giobuelai ada alamana giveleda, e ada kana alamanena Banae Yaubada velemoena. Ada ideyavo kaveseyana Banae Yaubada velemoena wagaine, faina kaveseyana Natuna Yeisu Keliso wagaine. Banae ani Yaubada velemoena ada Banae anakaibe yawai-vagata vuvuna.   
\p
\v 21 Natukuweyavo, taumiyavo wana itaveyabimi yaubada fwayafwaya wagaidiya.  
\cls Iyayeku Iyoni   